===Pronunciation===
*:Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-eɪvən|-eɪvən]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[harbour]] or [[anchorage]] protected from the sea.
# (''by extension'') A place of [[safety]]; a refuge or sanctuary.

